If AOC is just an actor, the obvious question is: who writes the script?

The first temptation is to answer: Soros.

But the reality is that he doesn't – he doesn't need to. He is above that.

He created the network that distributes the script, internationally, and the people inside it are not stupid. They know very well which scripts to write and distribute – otherwise they stop being distributed…

Look at the parts of the machine:

– the "news" channels, which decide what counts as news;
 – the newspapers, which decide what counts as respectable;
 – the NGOs, which turn the script into "civil society demands";
 – the think tanks, which turn it into "expert reports";
 – the fact-checkers, which decide what counts as true;
 – the university departments, which turn it into "research" and teach it to the next generation;
 – the foundations, which decide who gets funded;
 – the international bodies, which turn it into "standards";
 – the elected prosecutors and politicians whose campaigns the network helped pay for, who turn it into law and enforce it.

Each part looks independent. None of them takes orders. They don't need to: they all know where the grants, the invitations, the promotions and the prizes come from.

There is not even any need for a secret police – an NKVD or a KGB – to watch over them. They police themselves, and anyone who strays from the orthodoxy of the moment is instantly brought back into line. The KGB needed informers. This system only needs careers.

